{"product_id":"your-oxygen-mask-first-17-habits-to-help-high-achievers-survive-thrive-in-leadership-life","title":"Your Oxygen Mask First: 17 Habits to Help High Achievers Survive \u0026 Thrive in Leadership \u0026 Life","description":"\u003cp\u003eHere’s the hard truth about leadership: it either forces you to get stronger or it slowly destroys your life. There is no in-between. Kevin Lawrence has discovered seventeen habits that allow any leader to transcend the perils of success and keep achieving—habits that have already helped hundreds of CEOs and executives become stronger and more resilient. Obsessed with understanding why successful people crash and burn, Lawrence has studied and tested virtually every leadership theory known to humankind in his two decades as a business advisor. His straight-talk advice in Your Oxygen Mask First will surprise and propel even the most seasoned leaders as he cuts through the platitudes and jargon to share the best tools he has found to ensure your survival, no matter how high you fly.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kevin N. Lawrence\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781619617834\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 230\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45378629992601,"sku":"15RA-5-9781619617834","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/681e1a941875d_Your_Oxygen_Mask_First-_17_Habits_to_Help_High_Achievers_Survive___Thrive_in_Leadership___Life_Kevin_N._Lawrence.jpg?v=1746805598","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/your-oxygen-mask-first-17-habits-to-help-high-achievers-survive-thrive-in-leadership-life","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}